  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Evaluating an Integral by Mean Value Theorem</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Find the average value of the function  \(f(x)={@quest_expr@}\) and find the value of \(c\)  that satisfies the mean value theorem for \(f(x)\) in the interval \([{@value_a@},{@value_b@}]\).</p>
<p>Average value \(=\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p></p>
<p>\(c=\)[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>To find the average value of the function \(f(x)={@quest_expr@}\) over the interval \([{@value_a@},{@value_a@}],\)  you can use the following formula:</p>

<p>Average value \(=\displaystyle \frac{1}{b-a}\int_a^b f(x)dx\)</p>
<p>In this case \( ,a={@value_a@}\) and \(b={@value_b@} \) </p>

<p>Average value \(=\frac{1}{{@value_b@}-{@value_a@}}\displaystyle \int _{{@value_a@}}^{{@value_b@}} ({@quest_expr@}) dx\)</p>
<p>Intergrating \({@quest_expr@}\) with respect to \(x\) we get;</p>
<p>Average value \(=\frac{1}{{@value_b-value_a@}}  \left [  {@func_1@} \right ]_{@value_a@}^{@value_b@} \)</p>
<p>Evaluate this expression by plugging in \({@value_b@}\) and \({@value_a@}\) for \(x\):</p>
<p>Average value \(=\frac{1}{{@value_b-value_a@}}  \left [  {@constant@} \cdot {@value_b@}-{@coeff_2/2@} \cdot {@value_b@}^{2} \right ] \)</p>
<p>\(\qquad\qquad \qquad= \frac{1}{{@value_b-value_a@}}  \left [  {@constant*value_b@}-{@(coeff_2/2)*value_b^2@} \right ]\)</p>
<p>\(\qquad\qquad \qquad=\frac{1}{{@value_b-value_a@}}  \left [  {@(constant*value_b)-((coeff_2/2)*value_b^2)@} \right ]\)</p>
<p> \(\qquad\qquad \qquad={@ta1@}\)</p>
<p>Now, let's find the value of \(c\) suvh that \(f(c)\) equals the average value of the function over the interval \([{@value_a@},{@value_a@}]\)</p>
<p>\({@func_3@}={@ta1@}\)<p>
<p>\({@-coeff_2*c@}={@ta1@}-{@constant@}\)<p>
<p>\({@-coeff_2*c@}={@ta1-constant@}\)<p>
<p>\( \qquad c={@ta2@}\)<p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
